      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6gk",
          "text": "It is generally in your best interest to have legal representation during a pedestrian accident case in Thornton. The injuries involved may be serious or catastrophic, with long-term ramifications on your life. A ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6gm",
          "text": "Thornton personal injury lawyer",
          "marks": [
            "l6gl"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6gn",
          "text": " can help you negotiate or litigate for maximum financial compensation so that you have the money that you need to pay for current and latent medical care. An attorney can also make sure that your questions are answered and your concerns are heard as your legal advocate during this difficult time. You can relax and focus on healing while your pedestrian accident lawyer takes care of the rest.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6gq",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6gp",
          "text": "Who Is Responsible for Paying for Your Pedestrian Accident in Thornton?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6gs",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6gr",
          "text": "Like most states, Colorado uses a fault-based insurance law. This means that after an accident, including a pedestrian-vehicle collision, the person responsible for paying will be the one who is most at fault for the crash. This could be multiple parties, including:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6gu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6gt",
          "text": "The driver, for failing to exercise proper care while driving (negligence).",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6gw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6gv",
          "text": "An employer, if the driver was working for someone at the time of the crash",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6gy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6gx",
          "text": "A rideshare company, such as Uber or Lyft.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6h0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6gz",
          "text": "The entity in charge of pedestrian safety, such as the city or state government.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6h2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6h1",
          "text": "A vehicle manufacturer, for a brake or part problem that contributed to the crash.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6h4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6h3",
          "text": "If more than one party shares fault for a pedestrian accident, they may both be financially responsible. If you are worried that you could be found partially at fault for a pedestrian accident, you could still be eligible for financial compensation under state law. Discuss your case with an attorney before assuming that you are ineligible to recover.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6h6",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6h5",
          "text": "When Do Pedestrians Have the Right-of-Way in Thornton, CO?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6h9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6h7",
          "text": "One of the most common reasons behind Thornton pedestrian accidents is the failure of a driver to yield the right-of-way to the pedestrian. According to Colorado law, drivers have a duty to yield the right-of-way to all pedestrians who are in crosswalks. The driver must stop when the pedestrian is approaching the driver’s side of the road.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6hc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6ha",
          "text": "At marked and unmarked intersections, pedestrians in Colorado also have the right-of-way. If the intersection has a traffic control signal, however, the pedestrian must yield when it is red or says, “Don’t Walk.” If a pedestrian steps out into traffic when it is unsafe or he or she doesn’t have the right-of-way, the pedestrian could be at least partially responsible for the accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6he",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6hd",
          "text": "Pedestrian Injuries",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6hg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6hf",
          "text": "When a driver is distracted, drunk, reckless, or negligent, he or she can crash into a pedestrian and cause life-altering injuries. In a collision between a vehicle and a pedestrian, the vehicle will always win. Pedestrians are vulnerable road users who are at risk of many different types of injuries in accidents, including:",
          "marks": []
        }
