    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6iu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6is",
          "text": "At Dormer Harpring, LLC, we understand how dramatically a pedestrian accident can affect the victim’s life. We understand that no amount of money will ever be enough to make up for life-changing injuries, such as paralysis or permanent disability. Yet we have also seen first-hand how much a fair settlement or jury verdict can help a victim during a difficult time. We will fight for the compensation that you need to move forward.",
