      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6ix",
          "text": "The best way to learn how much your pedestrian accident case is worth is by talking to an attorney in Thornton. There is no such thing as an average settlement value; any “average” amount that you find online most likely will not indicate the value of your case. This is because your case is entirely unique and ",
