      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6jh",
          "text": "Typically, a pedestrian accident claim involving severe to catastrophic injuries or wrongful death will be worth more than a minor injury claim. Serious injury cases often involve higher amounts awarded in pain and suffering for a future of foreseeable losses. At Dormer Harpring, LLC, we will assess your pedestrian accident case to determine its fair value. Then, we will use proven legal strategies to demand the amount that you deserve.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6jl",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6jk",
          "text": "Are You Within Your Deadline for Filing a Pedestrian Accident Case Colorado?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6jo",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6jm",
          "text": "It is important to act quickly if you believe you have grounds to file a pedestrian accident insurance claim or lawsuit in Colorado. Most insurance companies have tight deadlines and require victims to file claims as soon as possible. In addition, Colorado has a law known as a statute of limitations that places a time limit on all personal injury cases.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6ju",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l6jr",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/thornton-wrongful-death-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6jp",
          "text": "Your deadline to file a pedestrian accident case in Colorado is two years from the date of your injury, with a few exceptions. If a loved one passed away in a pedestrian accident in Thornton and you wish to file a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6js",
          "text": "wrongful death lawsuit",
          "marks": [
            "l6jr"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6jt",
          "text": ", you will have two years from the date of death to file, instead. Contacting our pedestrian accident attorneys right away is the best way to make sure you don’t reach your filing time limit.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6jw",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6jv",
          "text": "Consult With a Thornton Pedestrian Accident Attorney Today",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6k1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l6jy",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/contact/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6jx",
          "text": "The pedestrian accident attorneys at Dormer Harpring, LLC are here for you if you sustained serious injuries or your loved one was killed in this type of disaster in Thornton, Colorado, or the surrounding areas. Please request a free consultation at our conveniently located law office today to discuss how we can help you seek justice and fair financial compensation. ",
          "marks": []
